    tldr: "Chinese thoracic oncologist behind HARMONi-2, where the PD-1/VEGF bispecific ivonescimab beat pembrolizumab head to head.", summary: "Qing Zhou led HARMONi-2, the first randomised trial in which a new agent (ivonescimab, a PD-1 and VEGF bispecific antibody) beat pembrolizumab on progression-free survival in PD-L1-positive NSCLC, and HARMONi-A in EGFR-mutant disease after TKI failure. She works alongside Yi-Long Wu at the Guangdong Lung Cancer Institute and leads CTONG trials.",
